<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia PSC seeks stock suspension.</title>
<headline>Malaysia PSC seeks stock suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipbuilder PSC Industries Bhd said on Monday it has requested a suspension in the trading of its stock effective from Tuesday pending an announcement.</p>
<p>The company made the request in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange. It did not provide any details.</p>
<p>PSC shares closed at 30.75 ringgit on Friday.</p>
